### Netcup SCP API — Tasks
# Async task tracking. Many operations return HTTP 202 with a task UUID.

### List All Tasks
GET {{base_url}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List Tasks with Pagination
GET {{base_url}}/tasks?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Search Tasks
GET {{base_url}}/tasks?q=REPLACE_WITH_SEARCH_TERM
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Filter Tasks by Server
GET {{base_url}}/tasks?serverId={{server_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Filter Tasks by State
# Valid states: PENDING, RUNNING, FINISHED, ERROR, WAITING_FOR_CANCEL, CANCELED, ROLLBACK
GET {{base_url}}/tasks?state=RUNNING
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Task Status
# Status values: PENDING, RUNNING, FINISHED, ERROR, WAITING_FOR_CANCEL, CANCELED, ROLLBACK
GET {{base_url}}/tasks/{{task_uuid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Cancel Running Task
# Returns 202 if cancel started, 204 if task already finished
PUT {{base_url}}/tasks/{{task_uuid}}:cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
